        "original_id": "7da8ddd2-1fc9-545c-9e93-63d1c5d4be15",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Frank Pepe Pizzeria Napoletana, Sarpino's Pizzeria\n- Places: Wooster Square, New Haven, Connecticut, Singapore, Lincolnshire, Illinois\n- Products: New Haven-style pizza\n- Topics: pizza restaurants, restaurant chains\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Pepe Pizzeria Napoletana is a popular pizza restaurant at 163 Wooster Street in the Wooster Square neighborhood of New Haven, Connecticut.\n- Frank Pepe Pizzeria Napoletana is known locally as Pepe's.\n- New Haven-style pizza originated at Frank Pepe Pizzeria Napoletana.\n- New Haven-style pizza is now served at many pizza restaurants in the New Haven area, notably Sally's Apizza and Modern Apizza.\n- Sarpino's Pizzeria is a fast food restaurant chain specializing in pizza.\n- Sarpino's Pizzeria has international operations headquartered in Singapore.\n- Sarpino's Pizzeria has U.S. operations headquartered in Lincolnshire, Illinois.",
